  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving farmers income through CSA and marketing (Rice)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this programme subsistence farming will be changed to business farming where the smallholders are organized in cooperatives and included in a broader part of the value chain for rice and cashew nuts. The aim is to improve the smallholder farmers&#x2019; living conditions through a combination of increasing income, creating new jobs and sustaining existing jobs through CSA. Commercialization of rice farming by focusing on rice trade, processing and marketing is one component of the programme. The pro</narrative>
  </description>
